 "description": "Variants in a genomic region (\u226425kb recommended). You MUST say which genome build your start/stop are in via assembly \u2014 there is no default, because a position is valid in both builds and a wrong guess returns real variants from the wrong locus rather than an error.",
 "inputSchema": {
